IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BGLTB.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT PST-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-PST-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
        ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-PST-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD PST-FILE.
01 PST-LINE PIC X(300).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PST-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-PST-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).
01 WS-TAG PIC X(04).
01 WS-GL PIC X(10).
01 WS-DC PIC X(01).
01 WS-AMT-STR PIC X(30).
01 WS-AMT PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-ENTITY PIC X(20).
01 WS-CUR PIC X(03).
01 WS-JRN PIC X(20).
01 WS-DATE PIC X(08).
01 WS-I PIC 9(04).
01 WS-FOUND PIC X(01).
01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(04) VALUE 0.
01 WS-MAX PIC 9(04) VALUE 50.
01 WS-TBL.
   05 WS-ROW OCCURS 50 TIMES.
      10 WS-R-GL PIC X(10).
      10 WS-R-DR PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
      10 WS-R-CR PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-TOT-DR PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-TOT-CR PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-DR-ED PIC -(15)9.99.
01 WS-CR-ED PIC -(15)9.99.
01 WS-NET-ED PIC -(15)9.99.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-STATUS PIC X(02).
01 LS-MSG PIC X(80).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-STATUS LS-MSG.
    MOVE "00" TO LS-STATUS
    MOVE SPACES TO LS-MSG
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-PST-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/journal/postings.log"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-PST-PATH
    MOVE 0 TO WS-TOT-DR
    MOVE 0 TO WS-TOT-CR
    OPEN INPUT PST-FILE
    IF WS-PST-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "35" TO LS-STATUS
        MOVE "POSTINGS LOG MISSING" TO LS-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ PST-FILE
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END PERFORM ACCUMULATE
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE PST-FILE
    PERFORM SHOW-REPORT
    IF WS-TOT-DR NOT = WS-TOT-CR
        MOVE "20" TO LS-STATUS
        MOVE "TRIAL BALANCE OUT OF BALANCE" TO LS-MSG
    ELSE
        MOVE "BALANCED" TO LS-MSG
    END-IF
    GOBACK.

ACCUMULATE.
    IF PST-LINE(1:4) NOT = "GLP|"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-TAG WS-GL WS-DC WS-AMT-STR WS-ENTITY
        WS-CUR WS-JRN WS-DATE
    UNSTRING PST-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO WS-TAG WS-GL WS-DC WS-AMT-STR WS-ENTITY WS-CUR
        WS-JRN WS-DATE
    END-UNSTRING
    MOVE 0 TO WS-AMT
    MOVE WS-AMT-STR TO WS-AMT
    PERFORM FIND-ROW
    IF WS-FOUND = "Y"
        IF WS-DC = "D"
            ADD WS-AMT TO WS-R-DR(WS-I)
            ADD WS-AMT TO WS-TOT-DR
        ELSE
            ADD WS-AMT TO WS-R-CR(WS-I)
            ADD WS-AMT TO WS-TOT-CR
        END-IF
    END-IF.

FIND-ROW.
    MOVE "N" TO WS-FOUND
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-COUNT
        IF WS-R-GL(WS-I) = WS-GL
            MOVE "Y" TO WS-FOUND
            EXIT PERFORM
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    IF WS-FOUND = "N" AND WS-COUNT < WS-MAX
        ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT
        MOVE WS-GL TO WS-R-GL(WS-COUNT)
        MOVE 0 TO WS-R-DR(WS-COUNT)
        MOVE 0 TO WS-R-CR(WS-COUNT)
        MOVE WS-COUNT TO WS-I
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-FOUND
    END-IF.

SHOW-REPORT.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-COUNT
        MOVE WS-R-DR(WS-I) TO WS-DR-ED
        MOVE WS-R-CR(WS-I) TO WS-CR-ED
        COMPUTE WS-NET-ED = WS-R-DR(WS-I) - WS-R-CR(WS-I)
        DISPLAY "gl=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-R-GL(WS-I))
            " debit=" WS-DR-ED
            " credit=" WS-CR-ED
            " net=" WS-NET-ED
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE WS-TOT-DR TO WS-DR-ED
    MOVE WS-TOT-CR TO WS-CR-ED
    DISPLAY "total-debit=" WS-DR-ED
    DISPLAY "total-credit=" WS-CR-ED
    DISPLAY "accounts=" WS-COUNT.
